# Test code inherits the project configuration (../.clang-tidy) with two checks relaxed:
#  - readability-magic-numbers: literal sizes, alignments and expected values are the test
#    data itself; naming each one would hide what the test checks.
#  - readability-function-cognitive-complexity: every Criterion assertion macro expands to
#    several branches, so a three-line loop of assertions already exceeds the threshold.
# Library code (src/, include/) keeps both checks.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity
